          "expectedValueJson": "\"开头读 /baɪ/，不要按旧音标读成 /bai/ 后再把其余部分误读。\"",
          "valueJson": "\"开头的 /baɪ/ 与 buy 同音，读作一个音节；后面的 /ə/ 要轻读。\""
        },
        {
          "op": "replace",
          "path": "/senses/0/patterns/2/en",
          "expectedValueJson": "\"biology helps/explains ...\"",
          "valueJson": "\"Biology helps explain ...\""
        },
        {
          "op": "replace",
          "path": "/senses/0/relatedExpressions/similar/0/note",
          "expectedValueJson": "\"范围较宽的说法，常涵盖生物学及相关领域；日常学校课程名称通常用 biology。\"",
          "valueJson": "\"在广义上可与 biology 接近；统称多个相关研究领域时常用复数 the life sciences。life science 也可用作学校课程名。\""
        },
        {
          "op": "replace",
          "path": "/senses/0/relatedExpressions/similarNote",
          "expectedValueJson": "\"life science 与 biology 相关，但前者常作涵盖多个研究领域的总称。\"",
          "valueJson": "\"biology 与 life science 都可指研究生命的科学，范围随语境而定；the life sciences 常统称生命科学的多个领域。\""
        },
        {
          "op": "replace",
          "path": "/confusions/1/takeaway",
          "expectedValueJson": "\"描述学科用 biology；修饰名词时常用 biological。\"",
          "valueJson": "\"biology 表示学科，也可修饰 teacher、class 等名词；biological 是形容词，表示“生物的、生物学的”，如 biological processes（生物过程）。\""
        },
        {
          "op": "replace",
          "path": "/confusions/1/items/1/example",
          "expectedValueJson": "{\"id\":\"ex152-6\",\"senseId\":\"s152-s1\",\"en\":\"We learned about biological changes in plants.\",\"zh\":\"我们学习了植物的生物变化。\",\"note\":\"biological 修饰 changes。\"}",
          "valueJson": "{\"id\":\"ex152-6\",\"senseId\":\"s152-s1\",\"en\":\"We learned about biological processes such as plant growth.\",\"zh\":\"我们学习了植物生长等生物过程。\",\"note\":\"biological 修饰 processes，表示与生命活动有关。\"}"
        },
